(7504064, 1195530, 186260, '<td valign="top">Well looking back at this the score distribution is all over the chart. A total of 6 people gave me 1s and 2s.  But on the other end of the spectrum 11 8''s.  What a weird score distribution. Overall I would have liked this to have done better but what can I say, it is what it is. <br/> <br/>Can''t really understand the scoring here, but o well.<br/> <br/>Someone mentioned they would like to see the hair removed, I agree, this would actually make for a better image. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-03-06 11:20:09.</i></td>', 'Well looking back at this the score distribution is all over the chart. A total of 6 people gave me 1s and 2s.  But on the other end of the spectrum 11 8''s.  What a weird score distribution. Overall I would have liked this to have done better but what can I say, it is what it is.  Can''t really understand the scoring here, but o well. Someone mentioned they would like to see the hair removed, I agree, this would actually make for a better image. ', '2017-03-06 11:19:24.000000', '2017-03-06 11:20:09.000000', 0),
